+/*
+ * Lenovo IdeaPad D330-10IGL (82H0): after S3 the MIPI panel comes back lit
+ * but with no image; the built-in resume path already re-runs the VBT
+ * sequences. A full i915 re-probe (the only known recovery) tears the
+ * encoder down and re-enables it from a quiesced state; defer one such
+ * cycle until after resume has settled.
